    <guid isPermaLink="false">68d3a88e522b40626c0ca0a6</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 24 Sep 2025 08:26:16 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这是一期新鲜出炉的釜山电影节特别说明书！无论你是第一次接触电影节，还是想获得更好的体验，这期播客都会为你提供最实用的一手信息。播客里详细介绍了釜山电影节如何排片、买票、看明星、领鸡蛋、衣食住行和电影之外的旅行建议。来一起了解这个亚洲最大的电影盛会吧！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="21">00:21</a> 说明书总览</span></p><p><span>1. 如何排片?</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="176">02:56</a> 1.1 釜山电影节的单元设置</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1004">16:44</a> 1.2 如何整理片单</span></p><p><span>2. 如何买票?</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1175">19:35</a> 2.1 电影节网站的介绍</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1239">20:39</a> 2.2 开幕式提前放票熟悉抢票流程</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1364">22:44</a> 2.3 抢票技巧：精兵冲锋</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1392">23:12</a> 2.4 抢票技巧：稳蹲回流</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1506">25:06</a> 2.5 抢票技巧：巧打地鼠</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1704">28:24</a> 2.6 抢票技巧：心诚则灵</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1813">30:13</a> 2.7 抢票技巧：早起的鸟</span></p><p><span>3. 明星鸡蛋</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1899">31:39</a> 3.1 看明星的三种方式</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2071">34:31</a> 3.2 如何薅电影节的羊毛</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2201">36:41</a> 3.3 买周边的破产技巧</span></p><p><span>4. 衣食住行</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2326">38:46</a> 穿什么</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2353">39:13</a> 吃什么（三种情况下的食物选择）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2664">44:24</a> 住哪里</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2737">45:37</a> 行路难（交通方案推荐/转场攻略）</span></p><p><span>5. 电影之外</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3142">52:22</a> 松亭-尾浦散步</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3328">55:28</a> 广安里海滩</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3494">58:14</a> 五六岛-二妓台徒步</span></p><p><span>如果你有任何问题或建议，欢迎通过评论或私信与我互动。</span></p><p><span>喜欢这期播客吗？别忘了订阅、评论并分享给你的朋友们！</span></p>]]></description>
