  <item>
    <title>15丨2025北影节/港影节：两个普通女观众的观影漫谈</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/683e664531215eb50603e529</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">683e664531215eb50603e529</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 03 Jun 2025 03:37:35 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>今年的北影节和港影节已过去一月有余，但留下的回忆仍然鲜活，本期播客从电影节说起，但却不止于电影，祝我们都能吃点好的，吃得开心～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="53">00:53</a> 港影节和北影节/上影节的体感差异</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="299">04:59</a> 作为盛会的电影节，与《巴黎夏日》相似，故事与事故并存</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="644">10:44</a> 没有那么电子化的港影节，如何“放飞”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1101">18:21</a> 今年都参与了出色的映后交流场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1460">24:20</a> 怎么看电影也要通勤啊？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1938">32:18</a> 总有奇妙的因缘际会</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2330">38:50</a> 电影节作为一种产业</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2483">41:23</a> Carrie的港影节选片思路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2912">48:32</a> Noema的北影节选片思路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3316">55:16</a> Noema的北影节最佳：《白天是阿波罗，夜晚是雅典娜》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3634">01:00:34</a> Carrie的港影节最佳：《性梦爱三部曲之梦》</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/654a00da5e184a3b76751a86/lmpRjumoE_bOO_N2qIvOIaYSznmv.m4a" length="76027542" type="audio/mp4"/>
