  <item>
    <title>14丨是不是每个人都有自己的“某种物质”</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67c96eb90766616acd0b0762</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67c96eb90766616acd0b0762</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 06 Mar 2025 10:04:17 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期播客虽迟但到，和Carrie畅聊三小时《某种物质》，然后发现我们都曾在某个时刻缩在自己的茧里注射孤独。如果身体是个人的最小政治，那么是什么在滋养镜中的恐怖？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="42">00:42</a> 黛米·摩尔与伊丽莎白的互文</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="212">03:32</a> 身体恐怖小史</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="342">05:42</a> 从弗兰肯斯坦到OpenAI奥特曼的“超级宝宝”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="629">10:29</a> 风靡美国的Ozempic和Lana Del Rey的自我表达</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="929">15:29</a> 医美，从一台手术到一项服务</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1170">19:30</a> 让我们来聊聊凝视镜头：恐怖谷效应</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1300">21:40</a> Sue是“人”吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1566">26:06</a> 所谓“珂学”，两种“伪人”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1945">32:25</a> 关于跳舞，你需要在镜子里看到一个性感尤物吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2222">37:02</a> 性缘关系里没有“欣赏的目光”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2621">43:41</a> 甩头发与咬嘴唇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3309">55:09</a> 影视剧里有不恶心的亲密动作场面吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3992">1:06:32</a> 当凝视具有媒介意识</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4195">1:09:55</a> 大S的腋毛和抗凝血剂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4713">1:18:33</a> 保持健康和对抗身体的界限在哪里</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5225">1:27:05</a> 成瘾剂量下《所有的美丽与血泪》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5432">1:30:32</a> 短视频也是《盐镇》的某种物质</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6117">1:41:57</a> 社交媒体的闪光灯让附近的人失去了光晕</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6248">1:44:08</a> 《某种物质》为什么是极具当代性的尝试</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6449">1:47:29</a> 中年人的自身关照与算法的注意力剥夺</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6970">1:56:10</a>《好东西》提供了小范围的新叙事，但旧叙事是否还会日复一日上演</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7200">2:00:00</a> 相互心理疗愈环节（bushi</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/654a00da5e184a3b76751a86/ln8ZPEkXxuXOhRqJtvGh7zsG380U.m4a" length="150896626" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>02:35:02</itunes:duration>
