    <guid isPermaLink="false">661e95085dae7932c6eb22e3</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 16 Apr 2024 15:11:04 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>今天是熊野古道的第一天</span></p><p><span>参拜了速玉大社和那智大社，淋大雨，在新宫城迹完全get山樱的魅力，赞美和果子店和家庭咖啡馆，给大门坂的伟大杉树起名字，在居酒屋搅拌金枪鱼盖饭，最重要的是一路感慨：“ta人好好啊！！！”</span></p><p><span>原本的行程如下：</span></p><p><span>🚶‍♀️新宫（买路餐，领双朝圣护照）-速玉大社📍-新宮城记-阿须贺神社-王子神社-高野坂-三轮崎</span></p><p><span>（9km，<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="600">10:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="780">13:00</a>）</span></p><p><span>🚌三轮崎-1️⃣1️⃣-Shioiribashi-3️⃣1️⃣-大门坂</span></p><p><span>（<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="794">13:14</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="847">14:07</a> 💰suica ¥850）</span></p><p><span>🚶‍♀️大门坂-那智大社📍</span></p><p><span>（<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="847">14:07</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="930">15:30</a> 3km）</span></p><p><span>⛩️参观那智大社，那智瀑布</span></p><p><span>（<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="930">15:30</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1050">17:30</a>）</span></p><p><span>🚌那智大社-3️⃣1️⃣-纪伊胜浦</span></p><p><span>（<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1052">17:32</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1081">18:01</a> 💰suica ¥630）</span></p><p><span>⛩️弁天岛，海上鸟居，那智金枪鱼盖饭🍛</span></p><p><span>（<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1081">18:01</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1140">19:00</a>）</span></p><p><span>🚄纪伊胜浦-新宫</span></p><p><span>（<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1151">19:11</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1168">19:28</a>，黑潮号）</span></p><p><span>🏠住宿新宫</span></p><p></p><p><span>我们在新宫住的老奶奶牌民宿：农舍旅馆 [Run‘s home]</span></p><p><span>大门坂的家庭咖啡馆：和笑庵</span></p><p></p>]]></description>
